    "title": "Xumo Play",
    "description": "When you download the Xumo Play app, you unlock free access to 300+ networks and an unlimited library of Hollywood movies, your choice of breaking news networks, popular TV shows, comprehensive sports coverage, plus family friendly and educational programming. Viewers love Xumo Play because we offer a fast and hassle-free experience - no registration, sign up or credit card required to enjoy. \r\n\r\nStream FREE Movies \r\nCheck out Xumo Play\u2019s impressive selection of free, on-demand movies. Relax with an old time classic, a hair-raising thriller, a laugh-out-loud comedy, or tear- jerker drama. When you open the Xumo Play app, you open the doors to a film library that contains over 1,000 movie titles in every genre. \r\n\r\nStream FREE Live News \r\nXumo Play is your source for live, breaking news. Tune in to your national or local news network of choice; Xumo Play carries all the top national news networks.  \r\n\r\nBinge Your Favorite Crime, Westerns & Country TV & Movies \r\nWhile you wait a week or year for the next episode or season to come out, Xumo Play has your favorite niche genre channels organized ready for the binge.  \r\n\r\nStream FREE Family Movies and Shows \r\nXumo Play\u2019s selection of free family movies and TV shows are available on 13+ on-demand channels.",
